    "## 10. Grouping and unstacking (slides 36–40, textbook §4.3.5)\n",
    "`groupby` **splits** the rows into groups, **applies** a function to each group, and **combines** the results.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Predict:** which borough has the widest trees on average?"
